{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solitary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a silent, white room.<br>No clues. No instructions. No color.<br>Only a chair, a bed, a table \u2014 and a voice that doesn\u2019t seem too concerned with your confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Solitary</i></strong> is a short first-person psychological experience about isolation, routine, and the slow unraveling of reality. Designed with minimal UI and ambient storytelling, the game leads you through a series of surreal spaces \u2014 each one stranger and more detached than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You won\u2019t be told what to do.<br>But you\u2019ll want to keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A series of abstract, atmospheric rooms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A padded white space that slowly populates with sterile furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A temple-like chamber of cold light and pillars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glowing platforms suspended in a dark, endless void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A maze with hidden rules and invisible truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And something waiting at the end... or maybe the beginning</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dynamic narrator who evolves with your choices \u2014 playful, observant, and maybe just a little too involved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quiet descent into something you were never meant to understand</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680860?t=1745262604","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3680860?t=1745262604","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680860/54109ed4f35ef1096eee19407a4c7d9f533f8b70/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745262604","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3680860/54109ed4f35ef1096eee19407a4c7d9f533f8b70/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745262604","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Solitary</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in a silent, white room.<br>No clues. No instructions. No color.<br>Only a chair, a bed, a table \u2014 and a voice that doesn\u2019t seem too concerned with your confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Solitary</i></strong> is a short first-person psychological experience about isolation, routine, and the slow unraveling of reality. Designed with minimal UI and ambient storytelling, the game leads you through a series of surreal spaces \u2014 each one stranger and more detached than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You won\u2019t be told what to do.<br>But you\u2019ll want to keep moving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A series of abstract, atmospheric rooms:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A padded white space that slowly populates with sterile furniture</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A temple-like chamber of cold light and pillars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Glowing platforms suspended in a dark, endless void</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A maze with hidden rules and invisible truths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And something waiting at the end... or maybe the beginning</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A dynamic narrator who evolves with your choices \u2014 playful, observant, and maybe just a little too involved</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quiet descent into something you were never meant to understand</p></li></ul>","developers":["Humza Shako